{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793248079.531623, "run_id": "e51a8174400549f1b4a441980bbd828a", "seq": 184, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "Cross-module log config mechanisms", "content": "environ.py: EnvVar is a non-data descriptor; __get__ locks, checks owner.__dict__ cache, else calls init(os.getenv(name)), wraps exceptions as type(e)(f'{name}: {e}'), then setattr caches. Factories int/int_or_none. rearm(name) resets the descriptor via setattr(envs,name,_descriptors[name]); rearm_all loops all. Add DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS in the Logging section with a factory validating int>=32. logger.py: NewLineFormatter.__init__(fmt, datefmt, high_precision, use_color) sets attrs; format() calls super().format(record) into msg, aligns multi-line using record.message, applies color last. _setup_logger adds the handler only once but always creates a new formatter and calls setFormatter, so pass the environ value there. stats_logger.py: logger=init_logger(__name__); _log_worker iterates queue batches and calls logger.info(m) per message; add extra={'keep_full_message': True} there to preserve full stats text.", "evidence_ids": ["ev-8554ade850ecb397d235", "ev-246c6e73a88cb2c9edc3", "ev-ef45633e339c9e5fd82f", "ev-30754515034e43628968", "ev-d69c220908cefeeae7f2", "ev-51e2fa3b9fc1aebe86f3", "ev-ddb5be78a5cf6218d616", "ev-c8859274b7c70879ff16", "ev-5a3c8c1ca1246b61b813", "ev-5abfdabfb975754c6683", "ev-ce7f3452865c2cce8902", "ev-730e378b9e68ec3effbd"], "section": "cross_module"}}
{"event": "context_note", "time": 1793248079.5320425, "run_id": "e51a8174400549f1b4a441980bbd828a", "seq": 185, "sources": ["deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py", "deepinfer/environ.py", "deepinfer/logger.py"], "content": "environ.py: EnvVar is a non-data descriptor; __get__ locks, checks owner.__dict__ cache, else calls init(os.getenv(name)), wraps exceptions as type(e)(f'{name}: {e}'), then setattr caches. Factories int/int_or_none. rearm(name) resets the descriptor via setattr(envs,name,_descriptors[name]); rearm_all loops all. Add DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS in the Logging section with a factory validating int>=32. logger.py: NewLineFormatter.__init__(fmt, datefmt, high_precision, use_color) sets attrs; format() calls super().format(record) into msg, aligns multi-line using record.message, applies color last. _setup_logger adds the handler only once but always creates a new formatter and calls setFormatter, so pass the environ value there. stats_logger.py: logger=init_logger(__name__); _log_worker iterates queue batches and calls logger.info(m) per message; add extra={'keep_full_message': True} there to preserve full stats text."}
{"event": "tool_result", "time": 1793248079.5321698, "run_id": "e51a8174400549f1b4a441980bbd828a", "seq": 186, "action": {"tool": "write_note", "title": "Cross-module log config mechanisms", "content": "environ.py: EnvVar is a non-data descriptor; __get__ locks, checks owner.__dict__ cache, else calls init(os.getenv(name)), wraps exceptions as type(e)(f'{name}: {e}'), then setattr caches. Factories int/int_or_none. rearm(name) resets the descriptor via setattr(envs,name,_descriptors[name]); rearm_all loops all. Add DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS in the Logging section with a factory validating int>=32. logger.py: NewLineFormatter.__init__(fmt, datefmt, high_precision, use_color) sets attrs; format() calls super().format(record) into msg, aligns multi-line using record.message, applies color last. _setup_logger adds the handler only once but always creates a new formatter and calls setFormatter, so pass the environ value there. stats_logger.py: logger=init_logger(__name__); _log_worker iterates queue batches and calls logger.info(m) per message; add extra={'keep_full_message': True} there to preserve full stats text.", "evidence_ids": ["ev-8554ade850ecb397d235", "ev-246c6e73a88cb2c9edc3", "ev-ef45633e339c9e5fd82f", "ev-30754515034e43628968", "ev-d69c220908cefeeae7f2", "ev-51e2fa3b9fc1aebe86f3", "ev-ddb5be78a5cf6218d616", "ev-c8859274b7c70879ff16", "ev-5a3c8c1ca1246b61b813", "ev-5abfdabfb975754c6683", "ev-ce7f3452865c2cce8902", "ev-730e378b9e68ec3effbd"], "section": "cross_module"}, "result": {"note_id": "cross_module", "sources": ["deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py", "deepinfer/environ.py", "deepinfer/logger.py"], "chars": 931}}
