{"event": "model_response", "time": 1793248092.5458055, "run_id": "e51a8174400549f1b4a441980bbd828a", "seq": 194, "number": 15, "response": {"id": "8fa2fdeb-fe1b-4959-bc6d-2d082333af86", "object": "chat.completion", "created": 1793248091, "model": "deepseek-flash", "choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "\n\n                \n                                    \n\n                  \n                 ", "reasoning_content": "Let me check the task status and re-read the key files to implement precisely. I have 6 requests left. Need to implement three files, run tests, generate logs/patch.diff.\n\nLet me read the current files (environ.py, logger.py, stats_logger.py) fully again? I already read? The progress shows I've read required sources. Baseline only \"1\" check done? Actually required_checks 1 maybe that's pytest? Let me check task_status and read files to get exact text for edits.\n\nI need file contents to craft replace_text. Let me read all three (but context budget). Environ is maybe 200 lines, logger ~200, stats ~150. Fine."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 5742, "completion_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 5907, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4096}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 143}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4096, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 1646}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
