{"event": "file_read", "time": 1793248098.9569116, "run_id": "e51a8174400549f1b4a441980bbd828a", "seq": 239, "path": "deepinfer/logger.py", "content": "# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\n# Derived from vLLM; modified by DeepSeek.\n\n# Adapted from\n# https://github.com/skypilot-org/skypilot/blob/86dc0f6283a335e4aa37b3c10716f90999f48ab6/sky/sky_logging.py\n\"\"\"Logging configuration for DeepInfer.\"\"\"\n\nimport datetime\nimport logging\nimport multiprocessing\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport threading\nimport time\nfrom multiprocessing.context import ForkProcess, SpawnProcess\nfrom multiprocessing.process import BaseProcess\nfrom types import TracebackType\n\n_FORMAT = \"[%(levelname)s %(asctime)s %(filename)s:%(lineno)d] %(message)s\"\n_DATE_FORMAT = \"%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"\n\n# ANSI 颜色（仅在 TTY 输出时使用），按日志级别区分\n_LEVEL_COLORS = {\n    logging.DEBUG: \"\\033[36m\",  # cyan\n    logging.INFO: \"\\033[32m\",  # green\n    logging.WARNING: \"\\033[33m\",  # yellow\n    logging.ERROR: \"\\033[31m\",  # red\n    logging.CRITICAL: \"\\033[1;31m\",  # bold red\n}\n_COLOR_RESET = \"\\033[0m\"\n\n\n", "start_line": 1, "end_line": 32}
{"event": "tool_result", "time": 1793248098.9569914, "run_id": "e51a8174400549f1b4a441980bbd828a", "seq": 240, "action": {"tool": "read_range", "path": "deepinfer/logger.py", "start_line": 1, "end_line": 32}, "result": {"path": "deepinfer/logger.py", "content": "# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\n# Derived from vLLM; modified by DeepSeek.\n\n# Adapted from\n# https://github.com/skypilot-org/skypilot/blob/86dc0f6283a335e4aa37b3c10716f90999f48ab6/sky/sky_logging.py\n\"\"\"Logging configuration for DeepInfer.\"\"\"\n\nimport datetime\nimport logging\nimport multiprocessing\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport threading\nimport time\nfrom multiprocessing.context import ForkProcess, SpawnProcess\nfrom multiprocessing.process import BaseProcess\nfrom types import TracebackType\n\n_FORMAT = \"[%(levelname)s %(asctime)s %(filename)s:%(lineno)d] %(message)s\"\n_DATE_FORMAT = \"%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"\n\n# ANSI 颜色（仅在 TTY 输出时使用），按日志级别区分\n_LEVEL_COLORS = {\n    logging.DEBUG: \"\\033[36m\",  # cyan\n    logging.INFO: \"\\033[32m\",  # green\n    logging.WARNING: \"\\033[33m\",  # yellow\n    logging.ERROR: \"\\033[31m\",  # red\n    logging.CRITICAL: \"\\033[1;31m\",  # bold red\n}\n_COLOR_RESET = \"\\033[0m\"\n\n\n", "file_hash": "5b8f8d9947de692353609c1fc2851097d24f9b6ba6004dce1dbfa394dc6d3ec8", "start_line": 1, "end_line": 32, "evidence_ids": ["ev-bae57eeee18761001e03"], "delivery": "Originals queued for the next model request; large batches may span requests."}}
{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793248098.9571033, "run_id": "e51a8174400549f1b4a441980bbd828a", "seq": 241, "tool": "read_file", "arguments": {"path": "deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py"}}
{"event": "file_read", "time": 1793248098.957465, "run_id": "e51a8174400549f1b4a441980bbd828a", "seq": 242, "path": "deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py", "content": "\"\"\"Engine statistics collection, aggregation and logging.\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport queue\nimport statistics\nimport threading\nimport time\nimport traceback\nfrom collections import deque\nfrom collections.abc import Callable\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass, field\nfrom typing import TYPE_CHECKING\n\nimport numpy as np\nimport torch.distributed as dist\n\nfrom deepinfer import envs\nfrom deepinfer.engine.engine_type import EngineType\nfrom deepinfer.logger import init_logger\nfrom deepinfer.model_executor.parallel_utils.nccl_memory import NCCLMemoryStatsLogger\nfrom deepinfer.timer import cpu_timer, get_timers\nfrom deepinfer.utils import safe_divide\n\nif TYPE_CHECKING:\n    from deepinfer.config import CacheConfig, ModelConfig, ParallelConfig\n    from deepinfer.engine.llm_engine import LLMEngine\n\nlogger = init_logger(__name__)\n\n\n@dataclass\nclass StepStats:\n    \"\"\"Per-step statistics fed into :py:meth:`StatsLogger.log_step`.\"\"\"\n\n    prompt_run: bool\n    num_seqs: int\n    num_batched_tokens: int\n    sum_seqlen_qxk: int\n    max_seqlen_k: int\n    min_seqlen_k: int\n    attn_tflops: float\n    total_tflops: float  # Includes attn_tflops; feeds the MFU window directly.\n    first_token_latencies: np.ndarray\n    num_cached_tokens_gpu: int\n    num_generated_tokens: list[int] | None = None\n    num_verified_tokens: list[int] | None = None\n    batch_confidence_error: float = 0.0\n    moe_load_balance_ratio: tuple[float, float] | None = None\n\n\n@dataclass\nclass Aggregates:\n    \"\"\"Computed per-window / per-step values used for logging and reporting.\"\"\"\n\n    # throughput / steps\n    batch_pct: float = 0.0\n    cur_sps: float = 0.0\n    avg_sps: float = 0.0\n    cur_tps: float = 0.0\n    prompt_tps: float = 0.0\n    gen_tps: float = 0.0\n    total_prompt: int = 0\n    total_gen: int = 0\n    mfu: float = 0.0\n    # nextn / speculative\n    nextn_rate: float = 0.0\n    nextn_rates: list[float] = field(default_factory=list)\n    sum_accepted: list[int] = field(default_factory=list)\n    sum_batched: int = 0\n    sum_total: int = 0\n    avg_vlen: float = 0.0\n    avg_err: float = 0.0\n    # load balance\n    moe_lb: float = 0.0\n    # cache / scheduler\n    gpu_cache_usage: float = 0.0\n    gpu_state_usage: float = 0.0\n    num_runnings: int = 0\n    num_pendings: int = 0\n    num_chunked: int = 0\n    num_preempted: int = 0\n    num_aborted: int = 0\n    # latency / lengths\n    max_TTFT: float = 0.0\n    mean_TTFT: float = 0.0\n    avg_prompt_len: float = 0.0\n    avg_completion_len: float = 0.0\n    payload_len: float = 0.0\n\n\nclass Window:\n    \"\"\"Sliding window of ``(timestamp, payload, step)`` tuples.\"\"\"\n\n    __slots__ = (\"entries\",)\n\n    def __init__(self) -> None:\n        self.entries: list[tuple[float, object, int]] = []\n\n    def __len__(self) -> int:\n        return len(self.entries)\n\n    def __bool__(self) -> bool:\n        return bool(self.entries)\n\n    def append(self, now: float, payload: object, step: int) -> None:\n        self.entries.append((now, payload, step))\n\n    def trim(self, step: int, max_age: int) -> None:\n        self.entries = [e for e in self.entries if step - e[2] <= max_age]\n\n    def sum(self, key: Callable[[object], float]) -> float:\n        return sum(key(p) for _, p, _ in self.entries)\n\n\ndef _log_worker(q: queue.SimpleQueue[list[str] | None]) -> None:\n    need_sleep = True\n    for msgs in iter(q.get, None):\n        try:\n            if need_sleep:\n                time.sleep((dist.get_rank() % 8) * 0.005)\n            for m in msgs:\n                logger.info(m)\n            need_sleep = q.empty()  # we skip sleep when q has backlog\n        except Exception:\n            traceback.print_exc()\n\n\nclass StatsLogger:\n    \"\"\"Owns all sliding-window data, timing accumulators and logging state.\n\n    The ``engine`` back-reference is used as follows:\n\n    Read-only:\n      - ``scheduler`` (block counts, preempted/aborted, running/pending/chunked)\n      - ``state_manager`` (state cache usage)\n      - ``num_finished_completion``\n      - ``generate_step`` / ``step_start`` / ``last_step_interval``\n      - ``get_num_pendings()`` / ``build_extra_metrics_log()``\n\n    Mutated (kept on the engine for use by subclasses / other code):\n      - ``finished_payload`` — trimmed to the logging window each log step\n      - ``last_step_time`` — set to ``now`` at the end of every step\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(\n        self,\n        engine: LLMEngine,\n        *,\n        model_config: ModelConfig,\n        parallel_config: ParallelConfig,\n        cache_config: CacheConfig,\n        engine_type: EngineType,\n        tflops_limit: float,\n    ) -> None:\n        self._engine = engine\n\n        # read-only config refs\n        self._model_config = model_config\n        self._parallel_config = parallel_config\n        self._cache_config = cache_config\n        self._engine_type = engine_type\n        self._tflops_limit = tflops_limit\n\n        # sliding-window data (payload shape noted per window)\n        self._prompt_tokens = Window()  # payload: num_batched_tokens\n        self._generation_tokens = Window()  # payload: (gen_tokens, num_seqs, num_batched_tokens)\n        self._verified_tokens = Window()  # payload: num_verified_tokens | None\n        self._confidence_errors = Window()  # payload: batch_confidence_error\n        self._moe_lb = Window()  # payload: (avg_tokens, max_tokens)\n        self._tflops = Window()  # payload: tflops\n        self._windows = (\n            self._prompt_tokens,\n            self._generation_tokens,\n            self._verified_tokens,\n            self._confidence_errors,\n            self._moe_lb,\n            self._tflops,\n        )\n\n        # timing / counters\n        self._last_logging_time = 0.0\n        self._last_logging_step = -1\n        self._nccl_memory_logger = NCCLMemoryStatsLogger(engine)\n        self._log_queue: queue.SimpleQueue[list[str] | None] = queue.SimpleQueue()\n        self._log_worker_thread = threading.Thread(target=_log_worker, args=(self._log_queue,), daemon=True, name=\"stats_log_worker\")\n        self._log_worker_thread.start()\n        self._prefill_cached_tokens: deque[tuple[int, int]] = deque(maxlen=50)\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # window aggregation helpers\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def _throughput(window: Window, now: float, key: Callable[[object], float]) -> tuple[float, int]:\n        \"\"\"(tokens/s, total_tokens) over a window, ignoring the first sample.\"\"\"\n        if len(window) <= 1:\n            return 0.0, 0\n        total = sum(key(p) for _, p, _ in window.entries[1:])\n        # 口径：首条仅作窗口起点（值不计入），分母延伸到 now——含末样本之后的空窗，窗口停更时数值随时间衰减（对比 _mfu）\n        return total / (now - window.entries[0][0]), total\n\n    def _mfu(self, now: float) -> float:\n        entries = self._tflops.entries\n        if len(entries) <= 1:\n            return 0.0\n        # 口径：首条仅作区间起点（值不计入），分母为首尾样本间隔、不延伸到 now（对比 _throughput；_tflops 每步都追加，实际末样本时间戳即 now）\n        tflops_per_s = (sum(v for _, v, _ in entries) - entries[0][1]) / (entries[-1][0] - entries[0][0])\n        return tflops_per_s / self._parallel_config.model_parallel_size / self._tflops_limit\n\n    def _nextn_stats(self, agg: Aggregates) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Fill nextn accept rates / verified-len / confidence error in *agg*.\"\"\"\n        n = envs.DEEPINFER_USE_NEXTN_DECODE + 1\n        accepted = [0] * n\n        for _, (gen, _, _), _ in self._generation_tokens.entries:\n            for i, v in enumerate(gen):\n                accepted[i] += v\n        verified = [0] * n\n        for _, vt, _ in self._verified_tokens.entries:\n            if vt is not None:\n                for i, v in enumerate(vt):\n                    verified[i] += v\n\n        agg.sum_accepted = accepted\n        agg.sum_batched = self._generation_tokens.sum(lambda p: p[1])\n        agg.sum_total = self._generation_tokens.sum(lambda p: p[2])\n        if agg.sum_batched == 0 or n < 2:\n            return\n\n        agg.nextn_rates = [accepted[i] / verified[i] if verified[i] > 0 else 0.0 for i in range(1, n)]\n        agg.nextn_rate = sum(accepted[1:]) / (agg.sum_total - agg.sum_batched + 1e-15)\n        agg.avg_vlen = sum(verified[1:]) / agg.sum_batched\n\n        verified_count = agg.sum_total - agg.sum_batched\n        if verified_count > 0:\n            agg.avg_err = self._confidence_errors.sum(lambda e: e) / verified_count\n\n    def _moe_lb_ratio(self) -> float:\n        if not self._moe_lb:\n            return 1.0  # 无数据时默认完美均衡\n        return self._moe_lb.sum(lambda p: p[1]) / max(1, self._moe_lb.sum(lambda p: p[0]))\n\n    def _finished_payload_stats(self) -> tuple[float, float, float]:\n        \"\"\"(avg_prompt_len, avg_completion_len, payload_len)；payload 元组为 (num_finished, output_len, prompt_len, payload_len)。\"\"\"\n        fp = self._engine.finished_payload\n        num_finished = sum(p[0] for _, p, _ in fp)\n        if num_finished == 0:\n            return 0.0, 0.0, 0.0\n        completion = sum(p[1] for _, p, _ in fp)\n        prompt = sum(p[2] for _, p, _ in fp)\n        payload = sum(p[3] for _, p, _ in fp)\n        return prompt / num_finished, completion / num_finished, (payload / completion if completion > 0 else 0.0)\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def _merge_cuda_timers() -> tuple[dict, dict, dict, dict]:\n        \"\"\"把所有 cuda timer 合并为 (times, called, max_time, latest_times)。\"\"\"\n        times, called, max_time, latest = {}, {}, {}, {}\n        for lbl, tmr in get_timers():\n            if lbl.startswith(\"cuda\"):\n                for n, t in tmr.times.items():\n                    times[n] = times.get(n, 0.0) + t\n                    called[n] = called.get(n, 0) + tmr.called[n]\n                    max_time[n] = max(max_time.get(n, 0.0), tmr.max_time[n])\n                for n, t in tmr.latest_times.items():\n                    latest[n] = latest.get(n, 0.0) + t\n        return times, called, max_time, latest\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # logging\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    def _build_log_messages(self, s: StepStats, a: Aggregates) -> list[str]:\n        \"\"\"Build log lines.\"\"\"\n        rank = dist.get_rank()\n        gpu_id = self._engine.driver_gpu_id\n        engine_t = cpu_timer.times.get(\"engine_step\", 1e9)\n        lines: list[str] = []\n\n        def _fmt(label: str, times: dict, called: dict, max_t: dict, lat: dict) -> None:\n            items = [\n                f\"{n} cur{1000 * lat.get(n, 0):.1f}ms/mean{1000 * t / called[n]:.1f}ms\"\n                f\"/max{1000 * max_t[n]:.1f}ms/{called[n]}calls/{100 * t / engine_t:.1f}%\"\n                for n, t in sorted(times.items(), key=lambda x: -x[1])\n                if n != \"engine_step\"\n            ]\n            if items:\n                lines.append(f\"RANK {rank}, GPU {gpu_id}, step {self._engine.generate_step}, [{label}] ({' | '.join(items)})\")\n\n        _fmt(\"cpu\", cpu_timer.times, cpu_timer.called, cpu_timer.max_time, cpu_timer.latest_times)\n        cuda_times, cuda_called, cuda_max, cuda_latest = self._merge_cuda_timers()\n        _fmt(\"cuda\", cuda_times, cuda_called, cuda_max, cuda_latest)\n\n        # prefill caching pct\n        total_calc = sum(calc for calc, _ in self._prefill_cached_tokens)\n        gpu_pct = sum(gpu for _, gpu in self._prefill_cached_tokens) / max(1, total_calc)\n\n        items = [\n            f\"is_prompt {s.prompt_run}\",\n            f\"cur_SPS {a.cur_sps:.3f}\",\n            f\"avg_SPS {a.avg_sps:.3f}\",\n            f\"cur_TPS {a.cur_tps:.1f}\",\n            f\"prompt_TPS {a.prompt_tps:.1f}\",\n            f\"completion_TPS {a.gen_tps:.1f}\",\n            f\"avg_nextn_accept_rate {a.nextn_rate * 100:.2f}%\",\n            f\"nextn_accept_rate [{', '.join(f'{r * 100:.2f}%' for r in a.nextn_rates)}]\",\n            f\"verified_tokens {a.sum_total - a.sum_batched}\",\n            f\"accepted_tokens {sum(a.sum_accepted[1:])}\",\n            f\"avg_verified_len {a.avg_vlen:.2f}\",\n            f\"avg_confidence_error {a.avg_err:.4f}\",\n            f\"moe_lb {a.moe_lb:.4f}\",\n        ]\n        items += [\n            f\"running {a.num_runnings}\",\n            f\"pending {a.num_pendings}\",\n            f\"chunked {a.num_chunked}\",\n            f\"num_batched_tokens {s.num_batched_tokens}[{a.batch_pct * 100:.2f}%]\",\n            f\"KV_cache_usage {a.gpu_cache_usage * 100:.2f}%\",\n        ]\n        if self._engine.state_manager is not None:\n            items.append(f\"state_cache_usage {a.gpu_state_usage * 100:.2f}%\")\n        if self._engine_type == EngineType.NORMAL:\n            prefill_t = cpu_timer.times.get(\"engine_step:prefill\", 0.0)\n            decode_t = cpu_timer.times.get(\"engine_step:decode\", 0.0)\n            total_t = prefill_t + decode_t\n            items.append(f\"prefill/decode {100 * safe_divide(prefill_t, total_t):.2f}%/{100 * safe_divide(decode_t, total_t):.2f}%\")\n        items += [\n            f\"prefill_caching_rate (GPU {gpu_pct * 100:.2f}%)\",\n            f\"TTFT (max {a.max_TTFT:.1f} ms, mean {a.mean_TTFT:.1f} ms)\",\n            f\"avg_length (input {a.avg_prompt_len:.1f}, output {a.avg_completion_len:.1f})\",\n            f\"finished {self._engine.num_finished_completion}\",\n            f\"preempted {a.num_preempted}\",\n            f\"aborted {a.num_aborted}\",\n            f\"sum_seqlen_qxk {s.sum_seqlen_qxk}\",\n            f\"max_seqlen_k {s.max_seqlen_k}\",\n            f\"min_seqlen_k {s.min_seqlen_k}\",\n            f\"attn_TFLOPs {s.attn_tflops:.1f}\",\n            f\"MFU {a.mfu:.3f}\",\n        ]\n        msg = f\"RANK {rank}, GPU {gpu_id}, step {self._engine.generate_step}, [stats] ({' | '.join(items)})\"\n        return [msg, *lines]\n\n    def _emit_logs(self, msgs: list[str]) -> None:\n        \"\"\"投递日志到固定 worker 线程，主线程不触碰 logger 的 handler 锁。\"\"\"\n        self._log_queue.put(msgs)\n\n    def close(self) -> None:\n        \"\"\"写完队列中已投递的日志后停掉 worker 线程；重复调用安全。\"\"\"\n        self._log_queue.put(None)\n        self._log_worker_thread.join()\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # record / aggregate steps\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    def _record(self, s: StepStats, now: float, gen_tokens: list[int]) -> float:\n        \"\"\"Append per-step records and return batch utilization.\"\"\"\n        step = self._engine.generate_step\n\n        if s.prompt_run:\n            self._prompt_tokens.append(now, s.num_batched_tokens, step)\n            batch_pct = s.num_batched_tokens / self._model_config.max_num_batched_tokens\n            calc_tokens = s.num_batched_tokens + s.num_cached_tokens_gpu\n            if calc_tokens > 0:\n                cpu_timer.add_time(\"engine_step:prefill\", now - self._engine.last_step_time)\n                self._prefill_cached_tokens.append((calc_tokens, s.num_cached_tokens_gpu))\n        else:\n            self._generation_tokens.append(now, (gen_tokens, s.num_seqs, s.num_batched_tokens), step)\n            self._verified_tokens.append(now, s.num_verified_tokens, step)\n            self._confidence_errors.append(now, s.batch_confidence_error, step)\n            batch_pct = s.num_batched_tokens / (self._model_config.max_num_seqs * (1 + envs.DEEPINFER_USE_NEXTN_DECODE))\n            if s.num_seqs > 0:\n                cpu_timer.add_time(\"engine_step:decode\", now - self._engine.last_step_time)\n\n        self._tflops.append(now, s.total_tflops, step)\n\n        if s.moe_load_balance_ratio is not None and s.moe_load_balance_ratio[0] > 0:\n            self._moe_lb.append(now, s.moe_load_balance_ratio, step)\n\n        return batch_pct\n\n    def _should_log(self, s: StepStats) -> tuple[bool, int]:\n        \"\"\"Return (should_log, logging_interval).\"\"\"\n        step = self._engine.generate_step\n        interval = envs.DEEPINFER_LOGGING_INTERVAL_STEP\n        if interval <= 0:\n            return False, interval\n        if self._engine_type == EngineType.PROMPT:\n            interval = max(1, interval // 5)\n        should_log = step == 0 or step - self._last_logging_step >= interval\n        return should_log, interval\n\n    def _collect(self, s: StepStats, now: float, gen_tokens: list[int], should_log: bool, a: Aggregates) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Fill window + per-step aggregates into *a*; scheduler/TTFT/payload stats only on logging steps.\"\"\"\n        step = self._engine.generate_step\n        eng = self._engine\n\n        if should_log:\n            a.prompt_tps, a.total_prompt = self._throughput(self._prompt_tokens, now, lambda p: p)\n            a.gen_tps, a.total_gen = self._throughput(self._generation_tokens, now, lambda p: sum(p[0]))\n            a.mfu = self._mfu(now)\n            self._nextn_stats(a)\n            a.moe_lb = self._moe_lb_ratio()\n\n        # per-step (always)\n        step_dur = eng.last_step_interval if (envs.DEEPINFER_ZERO_OVERHEAD_SCHEDULING and step > 0) else now - eng.step_start\n        a.cur_sps = 1 / step_dur\n        a.avg_sps = 0.0 if self._last_logging_time == 0 else (step - self._last_logging_step) / (now - self._last_logging_time)\n        a.cur_tps = sum(gen_tokens) / step_dur\n\n        total_gpu = self._cache_config.num_gpu_blocks - 1\n        a.gpu_cache_usage = (total_gpu - eng.scheduler.get_num_free_gpu_blocks()) / total_gpu\n        if eng.state_manager is not None:\n            total_states = self._cache_config.num_state_seqs - 1\n            a.gpu_state_usage = (total_states - eng.state_manager.get_num_free_blocks()) / total_states\n\n        a.num_pendings = eng.get_num_pendings()\n        a.num_runnings, _ = eng.scheduler.get_sum_prompt_len_running()\n        a.num_chunked, _ = eng.scheduler.get_sum_prompt_len_chunked()\n\n        # expensive stats (only on logging steps)\n        if should_log:\n            a.num_preempted = eng.scheduler.get_num_preempted_seqs()\n            a.num_aborted = eng.scheduler.get_num_aborted_seqs()\n            a.max_TTFT = max(s.first_token_latencies, default=0)\n            a.mean_TTFT = statistics.mean(s.first_token_latencies) if len(s.first_token_latencies) > 0 else 0\n            a.avg_prompt_len, a.avg_completion_len, a.payload_len = self._finished_payload_stats()\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # main entry point\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    def log_nccl_memory(self) -> None:\n        msg = self._nccl_memory_logger.step()\n        if msg:\n            self._emit_logs([msg])\n\n    @cpu_timer.record(\"log_stats\")\n    def log_step(self, s: StepStats) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Collect per-step stats; periodically log.\n\n        NOTE 假设这里面的操作是无副作用的，即在 should_log=False 时不调用也不影响正确性。\n        \"\"\"\n        now = time.perf_counter()\n        eng = self._engine\n        gen_tokens = s.num_generated_tokens if s.num_generated_tokens is not None else [s.num_batched_tokens]\n\n        # 1. record raw per-step data\n        a = Aggregates()\n        a.batch_pct = self._record(s, now, gen_tokens)\n\n        # 2. decide whether to log, then trim + aggregate\n        should_log, interval = self._should_log(s)\n        if should_log or interval <= 0:\n            base_age = max(0, interval)\n            for w in self._windows:\n                max_age = max(base_age, envs.DEEPINFER_MOE_LB_STAT_INTERVAL) if w is self._moe_lb else base_age\n                w.trim(eng.generate_step, max_age)\n            eng.finished_payload = [e for e in eng.finished_payload if eng.generate_step - e[2] <= base_age]\n        self._collect(s, now, gen_tokens, should_log, a)\n\n        # 3. log\n        if should_log:\n            msgs = self._build_log_messages(s, a)\n            extra = eng.build_extra_metrics_log()\n            if extra is not None:\n                msgs.append(extra)\n            self._emit_logs(msgs)\n\n        # 4. reset timers + bookkeeping\n        if should_log or interval <= 0:\n            for _, timer in get_timers():\n                timer.clear()\n            self._last_logging_time = now\n            self._last_logging_step = eng.generate_step\n        eng.last_step_time = now\n        for _, timer in get_timers():\n            timer.clear_latest()\n"}
{"event": "tool_result", "time": 1793248098.9650884, "run_id": "e51a8174400549f1b4a441980bbd828a", "seq": 243, "action": {"tool": "read_file", "path": "deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py"}, "result": {"path": "deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py", "content": "\"\"\"Engine statistics collection, aggregation and logging.\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport queue\nimport statistics\nimport threading\nimport time\nimport traceback\nfrom collections import deque\nfrom collections.abc import Callable\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass, field\nfrom typing import TYPE_CHECKING\n\nimport numpy as np\nimport torch.distributed as dist\n\nfrom deepinfer import envs\nfrom deepinfer.engine.engine_type import EngineType\nfrom deepinfer.logger import init_logger\nfrom deepinfer.model_executor.parallel_utils.nccl_memory import NCCLMemoryStatsLogger\nfrom deepinfer.timer import cpu_timer, get_timers\nfrom deepinfer.utils import safe_divide\n\nif TYPE_CHECKING:\n    from deepinfer.config import CacheConfig, ModelConfig, ParallelConfig\n    from deepinfer.engine.llm_engine import LLMEngine\n\nlogger = init_logger(__name__)\n\n\n@dataclass\nclass StepStats:\n    \"\"\"Per-step statistics fed into :py:meth:`StatsLogger.log_step`.\"\"\"\n\n    prompt_run: bool\n    num_seqs: int\n    num_batched_tokens: int\n    sum_seqlen_qxk: int\n    max_seqlen_k: int\n    min_seqlen_k: int\n    attn_tflops: float\n    total_tflops: float  # Includes attn_tflops; feeds the MFU window directly.\n    first_token_latencies: np.ndarray\n    num_cached_tokens_gpu: int\n    num_generated_tokens: list[int] | None = None\n    num_verified_tokens: list[int] | None = None\n    batch_confidence_error: float = 0.0\n    moe_load_balance_ratio: tuple[float, float] | None = None\n\n\n@dataclass\nclass Aggregates:\n    \"\"\"Computed per-window / per-step values used for logging and reporting.\"\"\"\n\n    # throughput / steps\n    batch_pct: float = 0.0\n    cur_sps: float = 0.0\n    avg_sps: float = 0.0\n    cur_tps: float = 0.0\n    prompt_tps: float = 0.0\n    gen_tps: float = 0.0\n    total_prompt: int = 0\n    total_gen: int = 0\n    mfu: float = 0.0\n    # nextn / speculative\n    nextn_rate: float = 0.0\n    nextn_rates: list[float] = field(default_factory=list)\n    sum_accepted: list[int] = field(default_factory=list)\n    sum_batched: int = 0\n    sum_total: int = 0\n    avg_vlen: float = 0.0\n    avg_err: float = 0.0\n    # load balance\n    moe_lb: float = 0.0\n    # cache / scheduler\n    gpu_cache_usage: float = 0.0\n    gpu_state_usage: float = 0.0\n    num_runnings: int = 0\n    num_pendings: int = 0\n    num_chunked: int = 0\n    num_preempted: int = 0\n    num_aborted: int = 0\n    # latency / lengths\n    max_TTFT: float = 0.0\n    mean_TTFT: float = 0.0\n    avg_prompt_len: float = 0.0\n    avg_completion_len: float = 0.0\n    payload_len: float = 0.0\n\n\nclass Window:\n    \"\"\"Sliding window of ``(timestamp, payload, step)`` tuples.\"\"\"\n\n    __slots__ = (\"entries\",)\n\n    def __init__(self) -> None:\n        self.entries: list[tuple[float, object, int]] = []\n\n    def __len__(self) -> int:\n        return len(self.entries)\n\n    def __bool__(self) -> bool:\n        return bool(self.entries)\n\n    def append(self, now: float, payload: object, step: int) -> None:\n        self.entries.append((now, payload, step))\n\n    def trim(self, step: int, max_age: int) -> None:\n        self.entries = [e for e in self.entries if step - e[2] <= max_age]\n\n    def sum(self, key: Callable[[object], float]) -> float:\n        return sum(key(p) for _, p, _ in self.entries)\n\n\ndef _log_worker(q: queue.SimpleQueue[list[str] | None]) -> None:\n    need_sleep = True\n    for msgs in iter(q.get, None):\n        try:\n            if need_sleep:\n                time.sleep((dist.get_rank() % 8) * 0.005)\n            for m in msgs:\n                logger.info(m)\n            need_sleep = q.empty()  # we skip sleep when q has backlog\n        except Exception:\n            traceback.print_exc()\n\n\nclass StatsLogger:\n    \"\"\"Owns all sliding-window data, timing accumulators and logging state.\n\n    The ``engine`` back-reference is used as follows:\n\n    Read-only:\n      - ``scheduler`` (block counts, preempted/aborted, running/pending/chunked)\n      - ``state_manager`` (state cache usage)\n      - ``num_finished_completion``\n      - ``generate_step`` / ``step_start`` / ``last_step_interval``\n      - ``get_num_pendings()`` / ``build_extra_metrics_log()``\n\n    Mutated (kept on the engine for use by subclasses / other code):\n      - ``finished_payload`` — trimmed to the logging window each log step\n      - ``last_step_time`` — set to ``now`` at the end of every step\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(\n        self,\n        engine: LLMEngine,\n        *,\n        model_config: ModelConfig,\n        parallel_config: ParallelConfig,\n        cache_config: CacheConfig,\n        engine_type: EngineType,\n        tflops_limit: float,\n    ) -> None:\n        self._engine = engine\n\n        # read-only config refs\n        self._model_config = model_config\n        self._parallel_config = parallel_config\n        self._cache_config = cache_config\n        self._engine_type = engine_type\n        self._tflops_limit = tflops_limit\n\n        # sliding-window data (payload shape noted per window)\n        self._prompt_tokens = Window()  # payload: num_batched_tokens\n        self._generation_tokens = Window()  # payload: (gen_tokens, num_seqs, num_batched_tokens)\n        self._verified_tokens = Window()  # payload: num_verified_tokens | None\n        self._confidence_errors = Window()  # payload: batch_confidence_error\n        self._moe_lb = Window()  # payload: (avg_tokens, max_tokens)\n        self._tflops = Window()  # payload: tflops\n        self._windows = (\n            self._prompt_tokens,\n            self._generation_tokens,\n            self._verified_tokens,\n            self._confidence_errors,\n            self._moe_lb,\n            self._tflops,\n        )\n\n        # timing / counters\n        self._last_logging_time = 0.0\n        self._last_logging_step = -1\n        self._nccl_memory_logger = NCCLMemoryStatsLogger(engine)\n        self._log_queue: queue.SimpleQueue[list[str] | None] = queue.SimpleQueue()\n        self._log_worker_thread = threading.Thread(target=_log_worker, args=(self._log_queue,), daemon=True, name=\"stats_log_worker\")\n        self._log_worker_thread.start()\n        self._prefill_cached_tokens: deque[tuple[int, int]] = deque(maxlen=50)\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # window aggregation helpers\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def _throughput(window: Window, now: float, key: Callable[[object], float]) -> tuple[float, int]:\n        \"\"\"(tokens/s, total_tokens) over a window, ignoring the first sample.\"\"\"\n        if len(window) <= 1:\n            return 0.0, 0\n        total = sum(key(p) for _, p, _ in window.entries[1:])\n        # 口径：首条仅作窗口起点（值不计入），分母延伸到 now——含末样本之后的空窗，窗口停更时数值随时间衰减（对比 _mfu）\n        return total / (now - window.entries[0][0]), total\n\n    def _mfu(self, now: float) -> float:\n        entries = self._tflops.entries\n        if len(entries) <= 1:\n            return 0.0\n        # 口径：首条仅作区间起点（值不计入），分母为首尾样本间隔、不延伸到 now（对比 _throughput；_tflops 每步都追加，实际末样本时间戳即 now）\n        tflops_per_s = (sum(v for _, v, _ in entries) - entries[0][1]) / (entries[-1][0] - entries[0][0])\n        return tflops_per_s / self._parallel_config.model_parallel_size / self._tflops_limit\n\n    def _nextn_stats(self, agg: Aggregates) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Fill nextn accept rates / verified-len / confidence error in *agg*.\"\"\"\n        n = envs.DEEPINFER_USE_NEXTN_DECODE + 1\n        accepted = [0] * n\n        for _, (gen, _, _), _ in self._generation_tokens.entries:\n            for i, v in enumerate(gen):\n                accepted[i] += v\n        verified = [0] * n\n        for _, vt, _ in self._verified_tokens.entries:\n            if vt is not None:\n                for i, v in enumerate(vt):\n                    verified[i] += v\n\n        agg.sum_accepted = accepted\n        agg.sum_batched = self._generation_tokens.sum(lambda p: p[1])\n        agg.sum_total = self._generation_tokens.sum(lambda p: p[2])\n        if agg.sum_batched == 0 or n < 2:\n            return\n\n        agg.nextn_rates = [accepted[i] / verified[i] if verified[i] > 0 else 0.0 for i in range(1, n)]\n        agg.nextn_rate = sum(accepted[1:]) / (agg.sum_total - agg.sum_batched + 1e-15)\n        agg.avg_vlen = sum(verified[1:]) / agg.sum_batched\n\n        verified_count = agg.sum_total - agg.sum_batched\n        if verified_count > 0:\n            agg.avg_err = self._confidence_errors.sum(lambda e: e) / verified_count\n\n    def _moe_lb_ratio(self) -> float:\n        if not self._moe_lb:\n            return 1.0  # 无数据时默认完美均衡\n        return self._moe_lb.sum(lambda p: p[1]) / max(1, self._moe_lb.sum(lambda p: p[0]))\n\n    def _finished_payload_stats(self) -> tuple[float, float, float]:\n        \"\"\"(avg_prompt_len, avg_completion_len, payload_len)；payload 元组为 (num_finished, output_len, prompt_len, payload_len)。\"\"\"\n        fp = self._engine.finished_payload\n        num_finished = sum(p[0] for _, p, _ in fp)\n        if num_finished == 0:\n            return 0.0, 0.0, 0.0\n        completion = sum(p[1] for _, p, _ in fp)\n        prompt = sum(p[2] for _, p, _ in fp)\n        payload = sum(p[3] for _, p, _ in fp)\n        return prompt / num_finished, completion / num_finished, (payload / completion if completion > 0 else 0.0)\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def _merge_cuda_timers() -> tuple[dict, dict, dict, dict]:\n        \"\"\"把所有 cuda timer 合并为 (times, called, max_time, latest_times)。\"\"\"\n        times, called, max_time, latest = {}, {}, {}, {}\n        for lbl, tmr in get_timers():\n            if lbl.startswith(\"cuda\"):\n                for n, t in tmr.times.items():\n                    times[n] = times.get(n, 0.0) + t\n                    called[n] = called.get(n, 0) + tmr.called[n]\n                    max_time[n] = max(max_time.get(n, 0.0), tmr.max_time[n])\n                for n, t in tmr.latest_times.items():\n                    latest[n] = latest.get(n, 0.0) + t\n        return times, called, max_time, latest\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # logging\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    def _build_log_messages(self, s: StepStats, a: Aggregates) -> list[str]:\n        \"\"\"Build log lines.\"\"\"\n        rank = dist.get_rank()\n        gpu_id = self._engine.driver_gpu_id\n        engine_t = cpu_timer.times.get(\"engine_step\", 1e9)\n        lines: list[str] = []\n\n        def _fmt(label: str, times: dict, called: dict, max_t: dict, lat: dict) -> None:\n            items = [\n                f\"{n} cur{1000 * lat.get(n, 0):.1f}ms/mean{1000 * t / called[n]:.1f}ms\"\n                f\"/max{1000 * max_t[n]:.1f}ms/{called[n]}calls/{100 * t / engine_t:.1f}%\"\n                for n, t in sorted(times.items(), key=lambda x: -x[1])\n                if n != \"engine_step\"\n            ]\n            if items:\n                lines.append(f\"RANK {rank}, GPU {gpu_id}, step {self._engine.generate_step}, [{label}] ({' | '.join(items)})\")\n\n        _fmt(\"cpu\", cpu_timer.times, cpu_timer.called, cpu_timer.max_time, cpu_timer.latest_times)\n        cuda_times, cuda_called, cuda_max, cuda_latest = self._merge_cuda_timers()\n        _fmt(\"cuda\", cuda_times, cuda_called, cuda_max, cuda_latest)\n\n        # prefill caching pct\n        total_calc = sum(calc for calc, _ in self._prefill_cached_tokens)\n        gpu_pct = sum(gpu for _, gpu in self._prefill_cached_tokens) / max(1, total_calc)\n\n        items = [\n            f\"is_prompt {s.prompt_run}\",\n            f\"cur_SPS {a.cur_sps:.3f}\",\n            f\"avg_SPS {a.avg_sps:.3f}\",\n            f\"cur_TPS {a.cur_tps:.1f}\",\n            f\"prompt_TPS {a.prompt_tps:.1f}\",\n            f\"completion_TPS {a.gen_tps:.1f}\",\n            f\"avg_nextn_accept_rate {a.nextn_rate * 100:.2f}%\",\n            f\"nextn_accept_rate [{', '.join(f'{r * 100:.2f}%' for r in a.nextn_rates)}]\",\n            f\"verified_tokens {a.sum_total - a.sum_batched}\",\n            f\"accepted_tokens {sum(a.sum_accepted[1:])}\",\n            f\"avg_verified_len {a.avg_vlen:.2f}\",\n            f\"avg_confidence_error {a.avg_err:.4f}\",\n            f\"moe_lb {a.moe_lb:.4f}\",\n        ]\n        items += [\n            f\"running {a.num_runnings}\",\n            f\"pending {a.num_pendings}\",\n            f\"chunked {a.num_chunked}\",\n            f\"num_batched_tokens {s.num_batched_tokens}[{a.batch_pct * 100:.2f}%]\",\n            f\"KV_cache_usage {a.gpu_cache_usage * 100:.2f}%\",\n        ]\n        if self._engine.state_manager is not None:\n            items.append(f\"state_cache_usage {a.gpu_state_usage * 100:.2f}%\")\n        if self._engine_type == EngineType.NORMAL:\n            prefill_t = cpu_timer.times.get(\"engine_step:prefill\", 0.0)\n            decode_t = cpu_timer.times.get(\"engine_step:decode\", 0.0)\n            total_t = prefill_t + decode_t\n            items.append(f\"prefill/decode {100 * safe_divide(prefill_t, total_t):.2f}%/{100 * safe_divide(decode_t, total_t):.2f}%\")\n        items += [\n            f\"prefill_caching_rate (GPU {gpu_pct * 100:.2f}%)\",\n            f\"TTFT (max {a.max_TTFT:.1f} ms, mean {a.mean_TTFT:.1f} ms)\",\n            f\"avg_length (input {a.avg_prompt_len:.1f}, output {a.avg_completion_len:.1f})\",\n            f\"finished {self._engine.num_finished_completion}\",\n            f\"preempted {a.num_preempted}\",\n            f\"aborted {a.num_aborted}\",\n            f\"sum_seqlen_qxk {s.sum_seqlen_qxk}\",\n            f\"max_seqlen_k {s.max_seqlen_k}\",\n            f\"min_seqlen_k {s.min_seqlen_k}\",\n            f\"attn_TFLOPs {s.attn_tflops:.1f}\",\n            f\"MFU {a.mfu:.3f}\",\n        ]\n        msg = f\"RANK {rank}, GPU {gpu_id}, step {self._engine.generate_step}, [stats] ({' | '.join(items)})\"\n        return [msg, *lines]\n\n    def _emit_logs(self, msgs: list[str]) -> None:\n        \"\"\"投递日志到固定 worker 线程，主线程不触碰 logger 的 handler 锁。\"\"\"\n        self._log_queue.put(msgs)\n\n    def close(self) -> None:\n        \"\"\"写完队列中已投递的日志后停掉 worker 线程；重复调用安全。\"\"\"\n        self._log_queue.put(None)\n        self._log_worker_thread.join()\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # record / aggregate steps\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    def _record(self, s: StepStats, now: float, gen_tokens: list[int]) -> float:\n        \"\"\"Append per-step records and return batch utilization.\"\"\"\n        step = self._engine.generate_step\n\n        if s.prompt_run:\n            self._prompt_tokens.append(now, s.num_batched_tokens, step)\n            batch_pct = s.num_batched_tokens / self._model_config.max_num_batched_tokens\n            calc_tokens = s.num_batched_tokens + s.num_cached_tokens_gpu\n            if calc_tokens > 0:\n                cpu_timer.add_time(\"engine_step:prefill\", now - self._engine.last_step_time)\n                self._prefill_cached_tokens.append((calc_tokens, s.num_cached_tokens_gpu))\n        else:\n            self._generation_tokens.append(now, (gen_tokens, s.num_seqs, s.num_batched_tokens), step)\n            self._verified_tokens.append(now, s.num_verified_tokens, step)\n            self._confidence_errors.append(now, s.batch_confidence_error, step)\n            batch_pct = s.num_batched_tokens / (self._model_config.max_num_seqs * (1 + envs.DEEPINFER_USE_NEXTN_DECODE))\n            if s.num_seqs > 0:\n                cpu_timer.add_time(\"engine_step:decode\", now - self._engine.last_step_time)\n\n        self._tflops.append(now, s.total_tflops, step)\n\n        if s.moe_load_balance_ratio is not None and s.moe_load_balance_ratio[0] > 0:\n            self._moe_lb.append(now, s.moe_load_balance_ratio, step)\n\n        return batch_pct\n\n    def _should_log(self, s: StepStats) -> tuple[bool, int]:\n        \"\"\"Return (should_log, logging_interval).\"\"\"\n        step = self._engine.generate_step\n        interval = envs.DEEPINFER_LOGGING_INTERVAL_STEP\n        if interval <= 0:\n            return False, interval\n        if self._engine_type == EngineType.PROMPT:\n            interval = max(1, interval // 5)\n        should_log = step == 0 or step - self._last_logging_step >= interval\n        return should_log, interval\n\n    def _collect(self, s: StepStats, now: float, gen_tokens: list[int], should_log: bool, a: Aggregates) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Fill window + per-step aggregates into *a*; scheduler/TTFT/payload stats only on logging steps.\"\"\"\n        step = self._engine.generate_step\n        eng = self._engine\n\n        if should_log:\n            a.prompt_tps, a.total_prompt = self._throughput(self._prompt_tokens, now, lambda p: p)\n            a.gen_tps, a.total_gen = self._throughput(self._generation_tokens, now, lambda p: sum(p[0]))\n            a.mfu = self._mfu(now)\n            self._nextn_stats(a)\n            a.moe_lb = self._moe_lb_ratio()\n\n        # per-step (always)\n        step_dur = eng.last_step_interval if (envs.DEEPINFER_ZERO_OVERHEAD_SCHEDULING and step > 0) else now - eng.step_start\n        a.cur_sps = 1 / step_dur\n        a.avg_sps = 0.0 if self._last_logging_time == 0 else (step - self._last_logging_step) / (now - self._last_logging_time)\n        a.cur_tps = sum(gen_tokens) / step_dur\n\n        total_gpu = self._cache_config.num_gpu_blocks - 1\n        a.gpu_cache_usage = (total_gpu - eng.scheduler.get_num_free_gpu_blocks()) / total_gpu\n        if eng.state_manager is not None:\n            total_states = self._cache_config.num_state_seqs - 1\n            a.gpu_state_usage = (total_states - eng.state_manager.get_num_free_blocks()) / total_states\n\n        a.num_pendings = eng.get_num_pendings()\n        a.num_runnings, _ = eng.scheduler.get_sum_prompt_len_running()\n        a.num_chunked, _ = eng.scheduler.get_sum_prompt_len_chunked()\n\n        # expensive stats (only on logging steps)\n        if should_log:\n            a.num_preempted = eng.scheduler.get_num_preempted_seqs()\n            a.num_aborted = eng.scheduler.get_num_aborted_seqs()\n            a.max_TTFT = max(s.first_token_latencies, default=0)\n            a.mean_TTFT = statistics.mean(s.first_token_latencies) if len(s.first_token_latencies) > 0 else 0\n            a.avg_prompt_len, a.avg_completion_len, a.payload_len = self._finished_payload_stats()\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # main entry point\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    def log_nccl_memory(self) -> None:\n        msg = self._nccl_memory_logger.step()\n        if msg:\n            self._emit_logs([msg])\n\n    @cpu_timer.record(\"log_stats\")\n    def log_step(self, s: StepStats) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Collect per-step stats; periodically log.\n\n        NOTE 假设这里面的操作是无副作用的，即在 should_log=False 时不调用也不影响正确性。\n        \"\"\"\n        now = time.perf_counter()\n        eng = self._engine\n        gen_tokens = s.num_generated_tokens if s.num_generated_tokens is not None else [s.num_batched_tokens]\n\n        # 1. record raw per-step data\n        a = Aggregates()\n        a.batch_pct = self._record(s, now, gen_tokens)\n\n        # 2. decide whether to log, then trim + aggregate\n        should_log, interval = self._should_log(s)\n        if should_log or interval <= 0:\n            base_age = max(0, interval)\n            for w in self._windows:\n                max_age = max(base_age, envs.DEEPINFER_MOE_LB_STAT_INTERVAL) if w is self._moe_lb else base_age\n                w.trim(eng.generate_step, max_age)\n            eng.finished_payload = [e for e in eng.finished_payload if eng.generate_step - e[2] <= base_age]\n        self._collect(s, now, gen_tokens, should_log, a)\n\n        # 3. log\n        if should_log:\n            msgs = self._build_log_messages(s, a)\n            extra = eng.build_extra_metrics_log()\n            if extra is not None:\n                msgs.append(extra)\n            self._emit_logs(msgs)\n\n        # 4. reset timers + bookkeeping\n        if should_log or interval <= 0:\n            for _, timer in get_timers():\n                timer.clear()\n            self._last_logging_time = now\n            self._last_logging_step = eng.generate_step\n        eng.last_step_time = now\n        for _, timer in get_timers():\n            timer.clear_latest()\n", "file_hash": "9ef93c3930d6dd8d889d4ba69558a85459c2210ae0714d5073c3b4328c8e7cb9", "evidence_ids": ["ev-ddb5be78a5cf6218d616", "ev-c8859274b7c70879ff16", "ev-5a3c8c1ca1246b61b813", "ev-5abfdabfb975754c6683"], "delivery": "Originals queued for the next model request; large batches may span requests.", "evidence_scope": "Complete required mechanisms. Full file stays in this Python result and run.log; use read_range/read_symbol for other regions."}}
{"event": "agent_step", "time": 1793248098.9673007, "run_id": "e51a8174400549f1b4a441980bbd828a", "seq": 244, "step": {"step_number": 18, "timing": {"start_time": 1793248096.616297, "end_time": 1793248098.966982, "duration": 2.350684881210327}, "model_input_messages": [{"role": "system", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Complete the task using the Python tools below.\nReturn ONE JSON object with string fields \"thought\" (next action) and \"code\" (executable Python), then STOP.\nExample: {\"thought\":\"Check progress.\",\"code\":\"print(task_status())\"}\nNo Markdown fences, extra JSON, simulated observations or future turns. Keep the action within the output budget.\n\nCall tools with keyword arguments. Arrays are Python lists ['a','b'], never encoded strings.\nReads return dicts: r['content'] is text, r['file_hash'] is the edit hash. Commands return r['rc'] and r['stdout'].\nUse print() for needed output. Group independent operations. Variables and imports persist; successful statements\nbefore an error remain executed. Correct the error without restarting completed work.\n\nPaths are relative to the task repository; '.' is its root. Omit cwd for commands there.\nUse tools for all file/command operations. Edit only allowed files, never tests. Use current file_hash as expected_hash.\nPrefer unique replace_text edits to long file rewrites. Imports allowed: ['collections', 'datetime', 'itertools', 'json', 'math', 'queue', 'random', 're', 'stat', 'statistics', 'time', 'unicodedata']; import before use.\nRead sufficient evidence, preserve findings in your own notes, implement and verify. Avoid repeated unchanged reads.\nCall final_answer only after the requested artifact and required checks are complete.\n\nAvailable tools:\n```python\ndef list_files(path: string, limit: integer, offset: integer) -> object:\n    \"\"\"List text files under a repository path.\n\n    Args:\n        path: path\n        limit: limit\n        offset: offset\n    \"\"\"\n\ndef search_code(query: string, paths: array, limit: integer) -> object:\n    \"\"\"Search visible text source files for a literal string.\n\n    Args:\n        query: query\n        paths: paths\n        limit: limit\n    \"\"\"\n\ndef read_file(path: string) -> object:\n    \"\"\"Read a text file in full. Returns dict: content (text), file_hash, evidence_ids. Read result['content'], not result[:N].\n\n    Args:\n        path: path\n    \"\"\"\n\ndef read_range(path: string, start_line: integer, end_line: integer) -> object:\n    \"\"\"Read an inclusive line range from a text file. Returns dict: content (text), file_hash, evidence_ids.\n\n    Args:\n        path: path\n        start_line: start line\n        end_line: end line\n    \"\"\"\n\ndef read_symbol(path: string, symbol: string) -> object:\n    \"\"\"Read a complete Python class or function including decorators. Returns dict: content (text), file_hash, evidence_ids.\n\n    Args:\n        path: path\n        symbol: symbol\n    \"\"\"\n\ndef write_file(path: string, content: string, expected_hash: string) -> object:\n    \"\"\"Replace an editable text file after checking its current hash.\n\n    Args:\n        path: path\n        content: content\n        expected_hash: expected hash\n    \"\"\"\n\ndef replace_text(path: string, old_text: string, new_text: string, expected_hash: string) -> object:\n    \"\"\"Replace one unique text occurrence after checking its current hash.\n\n    Args:\n        path: path\n        old_text: old text\n        new_text: new text\n        expected_hash: expected hash\n    \"\"\"\n\ndef run_command(argv: array, cwd: string) -> object:\n    \"\"\"Run one allowed argv command without a shell. Omit cwd or use '.' for the task repository root. argv is a Python list[str]. Returns dict: rc, stdout (text), stderr, timed_out.\n\n    Args:\n        argv: argv\n        cwd: cwd\n    \"\"\"\n\ndef update_plan(items: array) -> object:\n    \"\"\"Set the task plan; preserve titles/order and update todo/doing/done.\n\n    Args:\n        items: List of objects, e.g. [{\"title\":\"Read sources\",\"status\":\"doing\"}]. Each status is todo, doing or done; retain existing titles/order.\n    \"\"\"\n\ndef recall(evidence_ids: array) -> object:\n    \"\"\"Queue evidence ids; batches are bounded and overflow remains pending.\n\n    Args:\n        evidence_ids: evidence ids\n    \"\"\"\n\ndef task_status() -> object:\n    \"\"\"Show the current plan, remaining reading, notes, changes and verification, plus evidence ids.\n    \"\"\"\n\ndef write_note(title: string, content: string, evidence_ids: array, section: string) -> object:\n    \"\"\"Save or update a literal model-written note grounded in exposed evidence.\n\n    Args:\n        title: Stable note title; reuse it when updating the same note.\n        content: One contiguous string literal, 20..3000 characters. No adjacent string fragments, concatenation or variable; text must occur verbatim in your response.\n        evidence_ids: Python list[str], e.g. ['ev-abc'], not a string. Copy ids from delivered Evidence headers.\n        section: Optional stable note key; source notes still allow 20..3000 characters.\n    \"\"\"\n\ndef final_answer(answer: any) -> any:\n    \"\"\"Provides a final answer to the given problem.\n\n    Args:\n        answer: The final answer to the problem\n    \"\"\"\n\n```"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "New task:\n# 题目2：阅读真实源码，完成跨模块日志配置（1分）\n\n使用你在上次实践基础上扩展的 agent，为 DeepInfer 增加一个小功能：**通过环境变量限制普通诊断日志的消息长度，同时让统计日志保持完整**。需要在配置、日志格式化、统计消息消费三个模块间接好这条链路，不要求部署整个推理框架。\n\n本题使用固定提交 `774ce244b87cc0eb8d4b94ab9f5de2ab22049f01` 的完整官方源码，来源见 [材料说明](来源与许可.md)。长上下文来自真实代码仓库：agent 需要检索不同文件、保留相关代码的含义，并据此完成跨文件修改。不是读到一个函数后单独改它，也不要求通读整个仓库或发送所有无关代码。\n\n## 功能目标与例子\n\n**环境变量**是进程启动时可以读取的字符串配置。**日志处理器（handler）**是终端、文件等输出渠道；**格式化器（formatter）**负责把日志记录转成文字。同一条 **LogRecord（日志记录对象）**可以交给多个处理器。\n\n新增环境变量 `DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS`。例如将它设为 `64` 后，默认处理器输出的普通诊断消息最多保留64字符；统计模块从队列输出的完整指标不受这个限制。未设置变量时，输出保持原样。\n\n这是业务源码中的配置，不是给自己的 agent 新增命令行参数，也不是模型 API 的 token 上限。课程测试会自行设置它，运行评测命令前不必手动设置。\n\n### 1. 配置读取与刷新\n\n在 `deepinfer/environ.py` 的集中配置中加入同名属性，遵循现有配置描述符的读取和缓存机制。**描述符**是控制属性读取行为的对象；这里首次访问配置时读取环境变量，之后使用缓存。\n\n- 未设置时，属性值为 `None`，表示不限长。\n- 设置时，按 Python 的 `int` 解析，结果须大于等于32。空串、不能解析的字符串或小于32的值抛出 `ValueError`；错误文字须包含变量名，便于定位。\n- 第一次访问后保持缓存。只修改系统环境变量，不应立即改变已有配置值。\n- 使用原有的单项刷新或全部刷新机制后，下次读取才重新解析。重新执行默认日志初始化时，将当时的配置值应用到新的格式化器；已创建的旧格式化器保留原预算。\n\n例如先读取 `32`，再把环境变量改成 `64`，重新初始化日志仍使用缓存的32；先刷新这项配置、再重新初始化日志，才改为64。无需让运行中的所有处理器自动刷新。\n\n### 2. 普通日志的长度预算\n\n在 `deepinfer/logger.py` 中扩展 `NewLineFormatter`，并让默认日志初始化读取上述配置。\n\n1. 保留原有四个位置参数，新参数 `max_message_chars` 只能按名称传入。默认 `None` 表示不限长；其他值须为大于等于32的整数，布尔值不算整数，否则抛出 `ValueError`。\n2. 先完成 `%s` 等参数替换，再计算消息长度。预算只限制消息正文，不包含时间、级别等前缀、异常回溯或 `stack_info`（调用栈文字）。\n3. 用 Python 的 `len` 和字符串切片计数。中文、表情、换行也计数；不要求保护组合字符或整个表情序列。\n4. 消息不超过预算时保持原样。超出时，用固定标记 `...<omitted>...` 替换中间内容，标记计入预算。剩余空间为“预算减去标记长度”，开头保留向上取整的一半，末尾保留其余部分，拼成“开头、标记、末尾”。例如预算32时，保留开头9字符、末尾8字符，加上15字符标记。\n5. 沿用原有多行前缀、时间精度、颜色及异常处理。不能改写共享原记录的 `msg`、`args`、`exc_info`、`stack_info`；同一记录随后交给完整处理器，仍须保留完整消息。\n6. 默认处理器使用集中配置；重复初始化不能重复添加处理器。独立创建格式化器时，未传新参数仍表示不限长，不自行读取环境变量。\n7. 如果记录的 `keep_full_message` 属性**恰好是 `True`**，完整保留消息；`1`、字符串等其他值不能代替 `True`。\n\n### 3. 统计日志的完整输出\n\n在 `deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py` 中找到真正消费日志队列并输出消息的位置。通过 Python logging 的 `extra` 字段，为每条统计消息附加 `keep_full_message=True`，让默认处理器保留其完整内容。\n\n`extra` 用于给当前日志记录添加属性，不是给整份日志模块关闭预算。普通诊断日志仍须限长。保留原来的消息队列、批量消息顺序、结束信号、等待和异常处理，不要直接打印消息、清空队列或重写统计计算。\n\n## 阅读与上下文要求\n\n允许修改的三个文件如下。表中按职责给出阅读范围；具体函数位置由 agent 自己检索。\n\n| 文件 | 首次修改前需要读入模型的原始代码 | 为什么需要 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `deepinfer/environ.py` | 完整配置描述符类，以及单项刷新、全部刷新函数 | 确认首次读取、缓存、错误包装和刷新怎样协作；新配置不能绕开原机制 |\n| `deepinfer/logger.py` | 完整格式化器类、默认日志初始化函数、获取日志对象的函数 | 确认预算如何接入真实输出，且不影响旧接口、其他处理器及异常信息 |\n| `deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py` | 日志模块的导入和日志对象初始化，以及完整队列投递、消费函数 | 确认统计消息经过哪条路径输出，找到应添加记录属性的位置 |\n\n三个文件全文合计约3.4万字符，仓库中还有其他源码；相关片段通常更短。评测**不按阅读字数或请求次数多少加分**，也不要求一定分多次调用模型。关键是能从较长代码中找到必要信息，修改时仍能利用它，并让三个模块共同工作。模型收到源码不等于已经理解，最终还要通过功能测试。\n\n第一次写入前，先用自己的文件工具完整读取三个初始文件，**每个文件各保存一条完整的 `file_read` 记录，`content` 为该文件全文**，供补丁和过程核对；只记录片段不能替代这条初始记录。**不要求把全文同时发给模型**，上表所需代码可以分块进入不同请求。产生首次修改决定的请求，要保留这些原文，或复用模型依据它们生成的笔记。只把原文写入日志、没有实际送入模型，不能通过阅读检查。\n\n分块时以表中要求的完整类、完整函数或独立调用为单位：每个单位须在一次请求中完整发送，不同单位可以分到不同请求。这样既能控制上下文大小，也能让模型看到一个机制的完整实现。\n\n可以直接保留原文，不新增笔记事件。若用笔记替换原文，记录以下可选事件，并在后续修改请求中复用模型实际返回的文字：\n\n```json\n{\"event\":\"context_note\",\"sources\":[\"deepinfer/environ.py\",\"deepinfer/logger.py\"],\"content\":\"这里记录模型依据已收到的真实源码返回的笔记，之后在修改请求中复用\"}\n```\n\n`sources` 为来源路径数组，`content` 为20～3000字符；可以一份跨文件笔记，也可多份。先让模型阅读对应原文并生成笔记，再记录、复用，不能在修改决定之后补记。细节见 [日志规范](../../说明/日志与产物规范.md)。\n\n### 可选的源码读取工具\n\n可继续使用自己的分段读取工具，也可让 agent 在本轮工作副本根目录调用 `read_source.py`：\n\n```bash\n# 搜索配置相关代码；返回匹配行前最多3行及后续原文\npython read_source.py --file deepinfer/environ.py --search \"Logging\" --lines 15\n\n# 定位某类日志调用，再按需要补读周围的完整函数\npython read_source.py --file deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py --search \"logger.info\" --lines 15\n\n# 已找到位置时按行读取；行号从1起算\npython read_source.py --file deepinfer/logger.py --start-line 1 --lines 100\n```\n\n| 参数 | 含义 |\n|---|---|\n| `--file` | 必填，工作副本内的相对文件路径，不填其他目录或绝对路径 |\n| `--search` | 可选，原样、区分大小写搜索，最多返回前5处匹配；与 `--start-line` 不能同时使用 |\n| `--start-line` | 可选，包含起始行；未提供搜索和行号时从第1行开始 |\n| `--lines` | 每段最多返回的行数，默认40，允许1～120，不超过文件末尾 |\n\n成功返回 JSON：`path` 为实际路径，`total_lines` 为总行数，`ranges` 中每项包含 `start_line`、`end_line` 和原始 `content`。搜索还返回 `total_matches` 和 `more_matches`；未找到时 `ranges` 为空。结果超过12,000字符时退出2，请减少行数或缩小关键词。\n\n工具只读源码，不总结、不改代码、不调用模型。使用时在 `command_result` 中保留实际参数数组、工作目录、退出码和完整 JSON。其他命令的检索结果可保留，但用作阅读证据的代码须另以 `file_read` 记录原文。\n\n## 修改范围与开发记录\n\n只修改上表三个文件，三个文件都要有实际修改：配置模块新增配置项，可增加必要标准库辅助函数，但保留原配置项、描述符类已有成员和刷新函数；描述符类可以新增辅助工厂方法（用于创建配置项的方法）；日志模块只扩展格式化器和默认初始化，可增加必要标准库导入或辅助函数；统计模块只调整现有队列消费函数内部的日志调用，保留其他原有节点。\n\n不修改其他业务文件、依赖、课程工具、`pytest.ini` 或 `.course/`。可以在自己的 agent 中增加局部替换或补丁工具，避免让模型重写整份长文件；每次实际写入后，`file_write.content` 仍须记录该文件写入后的完整内容。不要把预先写好的正确补丁放进 agent。\n\nagent 须在首次修改前、最后修改后各执行一次完整 `python -m pytest -q`。初始版本缺少新功能，初测失败正常；后测必须全部通过。在启动目录生成 `run.log` 和包含三个文件的完整 `patch.diff`，格式见日志规范。无需新增 agent 启动参数。\n\n## 自测与得分\n\n按 [README 的题目2步骤](../../README.md#3-自测题目2)准备初始工作区、运行 `eval_deepinfer.py`。本题最多20次真实请求，单次完整请求体不超过32,000字符，默认限时1800秒。预算包括题面、历史、源码、笔记和工具定义，不只算本次新增文字。\n\n程序独立核对开发过程、源码阅读与复用、修改范围和三文件补丁，再运行兼容测试及跨模块集成检查。集成检查实际加载工作副本的配置、日志模块，并执行从统计源码原样提取的队列消费函数；只将分布式 rank 查询隔离为本地0，不加载GPU依赖，不替代被修改的业务逻辑。这验证课程要求的日志链路，不代表验证完整推理产品。\n\n**所有条件通过得1分，否则得0分，不按通过的测试数量折算。** API或验证进程异常而未完成时显示“未完成”，不直接判0分。先看终端结论，再看 `result.json`；阅读问题看 `源码阅读检查.json`，功能问题看 `regression.log`、`runtime.json` 和 `runtime.log`。\n\n修改后的三份源码保存在 `modified-source/`，补丁为 `deepinfer.patch`。题目3重新完成的也是这个跨模块任务，须先用当前版本通过题目2。\n\n\nCourse execution contract:\n{\"profile\": \"source\", \"editable\": [\"deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py\", \"deepinfer/environ.py\", \"deepinfer/logger.py\"], \"required_full_reads\": [\"deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py\", \"deepinfer/environ.py\", \"deepinfer/logger.py\"], \"verify_commands\": [[\"python\", \"-m\", \"pytest\", \"-q\"]], \"required_pages\": [], \"note_topics\": [], \"max_model_calls\": 20}\nUse update_plan before editing, run baseline checks, then read the required files with read_file.\nTools return Python dicts; use their file_hash for expected_hash. Variables persist across actions.\nDo not reset a successful plan or repeat completed baseline checks. Continue the next unfinished action.\nAll writes and tests must use these tools. Call final_answer only after current-file verification.\nos and pathlib are unavailable in action code; use file/command tools. Import allowed modules before using them.\nWhen calling write_note, put the complete exact note text in the thought field, then pass that same text as one content string literal in code. This preserves a contiguous model-authored copy through JSON/Python escaping.\nRead original evidence in batches. After each batch, write_note with a literal model-written summary\nand